{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1532288-permanent-torment-decreasing-dtf","id":1532288,"title":"Permanent Torment decreasing (DTF)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-03-09T06:20:09-08:00","id":1532288,"title":"Permanent Torment decreasing (DTF)","content":"In Demon the Fallen, when your Temporary Torment hits 10, it gets back to 0 and you gain a point of Permanent Torment.<br /> However, I believe the book does not fully cover the methods of losing Permanent Torment.<br /> <br /> - According to the book, players may expend 10 Experience points to <i>decrease</i> their Permanent Torment by 1.<br /> However, it does not mention what happens to the Temporary Torment, does it remain where it is while the Permanent Torment drops by one? does it reset to zero?<br /> <br /> - Additionally, I could not find a part in the book where it mentioned anything about what happens when your Temporary Torment drops below 0.<br /> <br /> I was wondering what would be your take.<br /> In my opinion, when a player uses Experience to decrease their Permanent Torment, the Temporary Torment should remain identical.<br /> However, when the character's Temporary Torment drops below 0, it should decrease the Permanent Torment by 1 and get the Temporary Torment back to 9.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25177-lirbo","name":"Lirbo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25177_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-09T11:36:41-08:00","id":1532295,"title":"","content":"Have them spend 1xp per temp to set the count back to 0 before letting them reduce Permanent?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-09T14:02:07-08:00","id":1532298,"title":"","content":"If my memory serves me correctly, every time the fallen does an action that helps another person without the intention of receiving something in return, she rolls conviction (I think) with the difficulty being equal to permanent torment, or 6 + the torment level; 1 low (1~3), 2 medium (4~6), 3 high (7~9); I think it was something like that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-25T11:20:31-07:00","id":1534707,"title":"","content":"It seems RAI is that reducing Perm Torment doesn't affect Temp points. But also, that it isn't possible to simply lower Permanent Torment through lowering Temp from 0.<br /> <br /> My personal take actually varies, but as default I follow the RAW/RAI with a caveat: if the char makes a really, really dramatic and rich scene about coming to grips with their past in the War, then I may let them reduce Perm Torment as if they had spent XP.<br /> <br /> Keeping in mind that Torment isn't about being nice, but about dealing with inhuman levels of PTSD.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}